WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.825
OR represents alternatives A row remains when at
least one condition is

00:00:04.850 --> 00:00:10.125
true In this example the diagnosis can be Pneumonia
Flu or Asthma

00:00:11.012 --> 00:00:16.163
This normally broadens the result because several
different values can qualify When

00:00:16.188 --> 00:00:19.450
multiple OR conditions compare the same column with
a list of values

00:00:19.712 --> 00:00:24.225
IN can often express the rule more compactly The
important idea is

00:00:24.250 --> 00:00:28.588
that OR does not require all options to be true Any
qualifying

00:00:28.612 --> 00:00:33.750
alternative is enough Later when OR is mixed with
AND parentheses become

00:00:33.775 --> 00:00:37.375
especially important because the grouping of those
conditions changes the meaning
